🖨️ Printing
The generated timetable can be formatted for printing.
Example:
              CLASS 10A TIMETABLE

       Monday   Tuesday   Wednesday   Thursday   Friday
---------------------------------------------------------
P1     Maths    Science   English     Maths      ICT
P2     Physics  Maths     ICT         English    Science
P3     English  Physics   Maths       Science    Maths
P4     ICT      English   Physics     Maths      English
P5     Science  ICT       English     Physics    Science

📱 Responsive Design
The system should work on:
* 💻 Desktop
* 💻 Laptop
* 📱 Mobile
* 📱 Tablet
The timetable interface should automatically adjust to different screen sizes.

